---
title: Refund record (compensation_records) states
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> REQUIRED : captured money cannot be used
  REQUIRED --> SUBMITTING : claim with lease, operation id stored first
  REQUIRED --> REVIEW : identity or amount not established
  SUBMITTING --> PENDING : accepted, not complete
  SUBMITTING --> PROCESSED : accepted and complete
  SUBMITTING --> FAILED : clear rejection, nothing created
  SUBMITTING --> UNKNOWN : timeout, reset or lost worker
  PENDING --> PROCESSED : provider processed it (fetch or webhook)
  PENDING --> REVIEW : provider failed, money not returned
  UNKNOWN --> PENDING : refund found by lookup
  UNKNOWN --> PROCESSED : refund found and complete
  UNKNOWN --> SUBMITTING : same-key retry, bounded
  UNKNOWN --> REVIEW : unresolved after 30 minutes
  FAILED --> REQUIRED : retry with a new operation, bounded
  FAILED --> REVIEW : retries used up
  PROCESSED --> [*]
  REVIEW --> [*] : a person resolves it (no tool yet, EDGE-6)
